   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "So that",
     "texto": [
      "**Affinché** (so that) + subjunctive: **Ti chiamo affinché tu venga** (I'm calling you so that you come).",
      "It is more formal than «per»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In order not to, for the purpose of",
     "texto": [
      "**Per non** (in order not to), **in modo da** (so as to), **allo scopo di** (for the purpose of) + infinitive: **Lavoro in modo da evitare il problema**.",
      "These are purpose phrases that keep the same subject."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
